[gd_scene format=3]

; One variable: `anisotropic_filtering_level` on two SubViewports that share one world and one
; material. Each viewport draws both panels at its own level, as Godot gives each viewport its own
; samplers (`render_scene_buffers_rd.cpp:120`). Left at 0 blurs the far stripes, right at 4 keeps them.
; No other golden draws one material in two viewports at different levels.

